    "excerpt": "Phew! In terms of the weather, the 2026 edition of the Fourth of July weekend won't soon be forgotten! For the first time since July 2-4, 1966, the mercury exceeded the century mark on three consecutive days at Millersville University exactly 60 years later. The high temperature of 102°F on Thursday, July 2, was one degree above the previous record high of 101°F from July 2, 1966. …",
